  "annotation": {
    "schema_version": 5,
    "type": "feature",
    "problem": [
      {
        "text": "Selective tensor-source replacement previously required a programmatic prefix map. The change adds YAML-driven overrides to shared initialization and model comparison.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_b2b96b609b624b048fe27ee1efa18c48",
          "call_56bb358af7214a86bbbcc59c72f990f4",
          "call_8c2c586a8cee4fbfb72671e2f84daec6"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "reasoning": [
      {
        "text": "A default collection plus filtered replacement collections allows selective substitution without constructing a merged checkpoint. Forwarding deferred-load operations is necessary because existing model loading brackets tensor requests with those operations.",
        "basis": "inference",
        "evidence": [
          "call_eb5f8b3812474d3488c2f50cff9831df",
          "call_bea39925058242c3be968c70cdd09d9b"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "impact": [
      {
        "text": "Shared initialization gains -or/--override; model_diff applies it only to model A. Both dependency declarations add pyyaml for the new yaml imports.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_56bb358af7214a86bbbcc59c72f990f4",
          "call_8c2c586a8cee4fbfb72671e2f84daec6",
          "call_7cd2e8bdf31d4b3991a2b92cba7f5aea",
          "call_d62c808be81d4a4594bf9fe3e063ae65"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "source_notes": [
      {
        "text": "The root loading-tokenization entry describes the original longest-prefix variant routing. The metrics entry records stale metrics wrappers and an odd-element CUDA BF16 conversion gap. The measures entry establishes the pre-existing model_diff diagnostics.",
        "basis": "ancestor",
        "evidence": [
          "call_0f64fbdd884b47feb1103da1e28d0eea",
          "call_251da69d1def4a969c26c7e5d5091468",
          "call_fa62a6ad591d42a0865ceeb9fddad74b"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fresh source inspection shows that the task removes VariantSafetensorsCollection.get_metrics, leaves Model.get_load_metrics calling the absent method, and preserves the pair-only BF16 conversion reached by forwarded deferred loads.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_eb5f8b3812474d3488c2f50cff9831df",
          "call_bea39925058242c3be968c70cdd09d9b",
          "call_b2b96b609b624b048fe27ee1efa18c48",
          "call_f4e29b158bf34a9f9412a298d783e785",
          "call_4b28f2dc53a146df94ec621fc5e64141"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "No repository loader, YAML parser, checkpoint load or GPU kernel was executed. The successful Python computation transcribed routing and pair-coverage arithmetic only.",
      "Replacement checkpoint dimensions and architectural compatibility were not validated.",
      "Searches establish inspected in-tree references, not compatibility with external callers or dynamically constructed arguments.",
      "Only initial portions of the lengthy PR #26 and issue #33 discussions were inspected; they do not establish this change's motivation."
    ],
    "links": [
      "543c4b27714c6a677a6e714c452d62532f634cff",
      "8d3477648f0a0e4ad7b305491244faa1a2e1dcb9",
      "2cc8f718dacbd75c2cfc3cc229dc787090333bde"
    ],
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": "loading",
        "title": "YAML-controlled tensor-source routing",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Both consumers safe-load YAML, map source IDs to model directories, resolve override keys to directories, and group filters by directory. They create one replacement collection per distinct directory and install a wrapper only when overrides are nonempty.",
            "basis": "source",
            "evidence": [
              "call_56bb358af7214a86bbbcc59c72f990f4",
              "call_8c2c586a8cee4fbfb72671e2f84daec6"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "The example selects attention tensors and particular layer indices from one source. These indices identify layers; they are not performance thresholds.",
            "basis": "source",
            "evidence": [
              "call_c250bf3fcf79450bac824e0f0cbe1d87"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "VariantSafetensorsCollection now accepts a main collection. add_stc prepends filter/source pairs; find_stc returns the first fnmatch match or main. This replaces longest raw-prefix precedence with reverse source-addition precedence. Because consumers group rows by directory, priority is not simply the order of individual YAML rows.",
            "basis": "source",
            "evidence": [
              "call_eb5f8b3812474d3488c2f50cff9831df",
              "call_b2b96b609b624b048fe27ee1efa18c48",
              "call_56bb358af7214a86bbbcc59c72f990f4"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "A standard-library transcription confirmed wildcard matching across dotted tensor names, B-before-A priority after grouping synthetic A/B/A rules, and main-source selection for an unmatched key.",
            "basis": "execution",
            "evidence": [
              "call_100f8dbe53f54c7193daa5a0f1a3342d"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Selection is authoritative: existence checks and tensor reads inspect the chosen collection without falling back when it lacks the key. Required reads retain the underlying missing-tensor error; optional reads retain None. Alternative suffix groups now support Linear.is_exl3_storage's su/suh and sv/svh checks.",
            "basis": "source",
            "evidence": [
              "call_eb5f8b3812474d3488c2f50cff9831df",
              "call_b2b96b609b624b048fe27ee1efa18c48",
              "call_1db9d6e920d049109d070b4a33b9df89"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "get_tensor forwards conversion, transpose, padding and no_defer arguments. Bulk reads and metadata listings enumerate main's names and then resolve each replacement, rather than forming a union of source namespaces. Replacement-only names are therefore omitted from those bulk operations. max_key_len also remains main-based.",
            "basis": "source",
            "evidence": [
              "call_eb5f8b3812474d3488c2f50cff9831df",
              "call_1db9d6e920d049109d070b4a33b9df89"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Deferred begin/end/abort and close fan out to all replacement collections and main. Model's existing loading paths use these operations; autosplit aborts pending work on exceptions. model_diff already brackets each module load with deferred begin/end.",
            "basis": "source",
            "evidence": [
              "call_eb5f8b3812474d3488c2f50cff9831df",
              "call_bea39925058242c3be968c70cdd09d9b",
              "call_80411d14ff7248f7b9c0d2d8f3b7a4f3"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Shared initialization installs the wrapper before Model.from_config. model_diff installs it after constructing model A but before loading modules; Model stores the same config object, so later config.stc accesses observe the replacement.",
            "basis": "source",
            "evidence": [
              "call_56bb358af7214a86bbbcc59c72f990f4",
              "call_8c2c586a8cee4fbfb72671e2f84daec6",
              "call_bea39925058242c3be968c70cdd09d9b"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Config's st_variants branch is removed. Whole-parent-tree searches found that constructor use only in Config and no other st_variants occurrence. External callers supplying that keyword no longer select variants. The new wrapper explicitly rejects set_new_tensors.",
            "basis": "source",
            "evidence": [
              "call_3ea4a873f62a40089ed8baf8efb6b1e6",
              "call_ab30d820f3944075950fae58606af123",
              "call_30b113363b564ecca1a0a7b3bf252c97",
              "call_eb5f8b3812474d3488c2f50cff9831df"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "The parent-tree yaml search found no occurrence. The task adds unconditional yaml imports to model_init and model_diff, including invocations that do not request overrides.",
            "basis": "source",
            "evidence": [
              "call_27901eb0137f48a3ac5b30be0cdbf4b7",
              "call_56bb358af7214a86bbbcc59c72f990f4",
              "call_8c2c586a8cee4fbfb72671e2f84daec6"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
